  "title": "Easy Apple Coffee Cake",
  "description": "This easy apple coffee cake recipe bakes up into an apple cake with a beautiful layer of fruit in the center. Serve it warm with a scoop of ice cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Carol Semenuk"
  ],
